# Build context hygiene — keep the image small and never bake secrets or local state.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage

# Local dev DB state (PGlite) — must never enter the image
**/.pglite-dev

# Foundry contracts are not needed to build the web app (49M of vendored libs)
packages/contracts

# Secrets / env — never copy into the image (compose injects env at runtime)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS / OS / editor
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
.claude
.vscode
